6. **claw-code** (github.com/ultraworkers/claw-code) — confirmed still up; the DMCA risk noted in the last wrap appears to have receded.

**Strategic note in the file:** ingesting either #5 or #6 likely promotes `permission-gate-as-architecture` to a concept, putting the harness cluster at 4 concepts (one short of MoC threshold). Items #1 and #2 similarly put the evolutionary-search cluster at 4 concepts.

